<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-TUNISIA QUALIFY FOR WORLD CUP FINALS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TUNISIA QUALIFY FOR WORLD CUP FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt and Tunisia drew 0-0 in their</p>
<p>World Cup African zone group two qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 29,000</p>
<p>    Standings	    P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Tunisia		   5   4   1   0   6   1    13</p>
<p> Egypt		     5   2   1   2  10   5     7</p>
<p> Liberia		   5   1   1   3   2   5     4</p>
<p> Namibia		   5   1   1   3   6  13     4</p>
<p>Tunisia qualify for the finals</p>
<p>Remaining matches: Aug 17 Egypt v Liberia, Tunisia v Namibia</p>
</text>
